<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don't always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We’re committed to getting you to your destination on time. However, sometimes things don’t go to plan and flight changes, delays, and cancellations can occur.<br />
<br />
I’d like to apologise on behalf of Qantas for the delay you experienced and the impact it has had on your work schedule.<br />
<br />
<strong>We’ve reviewed your case</strong>&nbsp;<br />
<br />
While we always strive to provide our customers with the best service possible, after carefully reviewing your case, we’re unable to compensate for any loss of wages.<br />
<br />
<strong>We're here to help</strong><br />
Although we can’t cover your loss of wages in this instance, if you have travel insurance your travel insurance provider may cover these sorts of situations. We would be happy to provide you with an insurance letter with the information you need to make a claim.<br />
<br />
Once again, on behalf of the team at Qantas, we apologise for the inconvenience experienced and look forward to welcoming you on board again soon.</p>
</body>
